# Freezed cubit states

All Cubit/Bloc states must be **freezed** unions. Do not use sealed classes,
hand-written subclasses, or plain enums for state machines.

## Required shape

- State file is `part of 'xxx_cubit.dart';`
- Cubit imports `freezed_annotation` and declares:
  - `part 'xxx_cubit.freezed.dart';`
  - `part 'xxx_state.dart';`
- Factories: `initial`, `loading`, `error` (with `AppErrors` + `VoidCallback`),
  plus domain-specific success/loaded variants
- Concrete type names: `{Feature}InitState`, `{Feature}LoadingState`, …
- Emit via factories: `emit(const XxxState.loading());`
- Listen with `when` / `maybeWhen` / `map` — not Dart 3 pattern-match on
  hand-written classes

## Example

```dart
// ❌ BAD — sealed / manual subclasses
sealed class AuthState {
  const AuthState();
}
class AuthLoading extends AuthState {
  const AuthLoading();
}

// ✅ GOOD — freezed (see item_list_state.dart)
part of 'auth_cubit.dart';

@freezed
class AuthState with _$AuthState {
  const factory AuthState.initial() = AuthInitState;
  const factory AuthState.loading() = AuthLoadingState;
  const factory AuthState.authenticated({required UserEntity user}) =
      AuthAuthenticatedState;
  const factory AuthState.unauthenticated() = AuthUnauthenticatedState;
  const factory AuthState.error({
    required AppErrors error,
    required VoidCallback callback,
  }) = AuthErrorState;
}
```

## Notes

- Do **not** hand-write `*.freezed.dart` — run codegen later
- Prefer named params on success factories (`user:`, `data:`) for clarity

## Use cases — resolve via GetIt (not constructor injection)

Cubits must **not** take use cases as constructor parameters. Resolve them
with `getIt` inside the cubit (field initializer or per call).

```dart
import '../../../../../di/service_locator.dart';

class PrayerTimesCubit extends Cubit<PrayerTimesState> {
  PrayerTimesCubit() : super(const PrayerTimesState.initial());

  final GetTodayPrayerTimesUseCase _getTodayPrayerTimes =
      getIt<GetTodayPrayerTimesUseCase>();

  Future<void> load() async {
    final result = await _getTodayPrayerTimes(params);
    // ...
  }
}
```

```dart
// ❌ BAD — constructor injection
class PrayerTimesCubit extends Cubit<PrayerTimesState> {
  PrayerTimesCubit({required GetTodayPrayerTimesUseCase getTodayPrayerTimes});
}

// ❌ BAD — dependency factory only to pass GetIt into constructor
PrayerTimesCubit(getTodayPrayerTimes: getIt<GetTodayPrayerTimesUseCase>());

// ✅ GOOD — parameterless constructor + getIt
final result = await getIt<GetTodayPrayerTimesUseCase>()(params);
// or private final _useCase = getIt<GetTodayPrayerTimesUseCase>();
```

Register use cases with `@injectable`; user runs codegen. Screens/widgets
instantiate cubits with `XxxCubit()` — no manual wiring factories.
